     "name_html": "Dried wide rice noodles"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Mince the garlic; deseed and very finely chop the chillies.</li><li>Slice the onion; cut the chicken into bite-size pieces and the green onions into <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"3\" data-s=\"0\">3 cm</span> lengths.</li><li>Mix the sauce in a small bowl:<ul class=\"ing two-col\"><li>oyster sauce <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"3\">3 tbsp</span></span></li><li>light soy sauce <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1.5\">1½ tbsp</span></span></li><li>dark soy sauce <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1.5\">1½ tbsp</span></span></li><li>sugar <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"2\">2 tsp</span></span></li><li>water <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tbsp</span></span></li></ul></li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-2",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Prep and mix the sauce",
    "diagram": null,
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Deseed the chillies, then chop them very finely.",
      "src": "illustrations/drunken-noodles/2-how1.webp?v=abf54aca1c"
     },
     {
      "caption": "Cut the chicken into bite-size pieces.",
      "src": "illustrations/drunken-noodles/2-how2.webp?v=424cad0d80"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/drunken-noodles/2.webp?v=17a7ffcc14",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 2,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "~8 min",
   "time_html": "<span>~8 min</span>",
   "title": "Prep and mix the sauce",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Heat the oil in a wok over high heat.</li><li>Add the garlic and chilli and cook for 10 seconds — don’t lean over the pan, the chilli fumes make you cough.</li></ul>",
